  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparative studies for the cooperation with the Baltic Countries will be carried out, principally on human resources-capacity at the Office of the Prosecutor-General, and also to analyse and map out the legal sector in the Baltic Countries from a prosecutors perspective. Swedish counterpart is the Office of the Prosecutor-General in Sweden</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Riks&#xE5;klagarens f&#xF6;rstudie Baltikum. F&#xF6;rstudien best&#xE5;r av tv&#xE5; delar; inventering av de personella resurserna hos &#xE5;klagarmyndigheten, dels en analys och kartl&#xE4;ggning av r&#xE4;ttsomr&#xE5;det i Baltikum utifr&#xE5;n ett &#xE5;klagarperspektiv. Svensk part &#xE4;r R&#xC5;.</narrative>
